# The way out, from each of the three places in the app. A menu entry can
# present this app directly, and an app presented that way is home: nothing but
# this slot leads back to the stock reader.
#
# Last step on purpose. Taking it ends the session, so the simulator closes the
# connection and nothing after it can be driven.
clean
expect Kobo reader
tap Library
wait-for My loans
expect Kobo reader
tap Settings
wait-for Connection
expect Kobo reader
tap Kobo reader
